,"surface":"長子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m021-0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002091","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m021-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002091","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m021-0213","start":213,"end":215,"surface":"長男","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002087","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p026","text":"至，其母及邑人盡哀之，唯朱公獨笑，曰：「吾固知必殺其弟也！彼非不愛其弟，顧有所不能忍者也。是少與我倶，見苦，爲生難，故重棄財。至如少弟者，生而見我富，乘堅驅良逐狡兔，豈知財所從來，故輕棄之，非所惜吝。前日吾所爲欲遣少子，固爲其能棄財故也。而長者不能，故卒以殺其弟，事之理也，無足悲者。吾日夜固以望其喪之來也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"其母","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002090","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002061","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"弟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002088","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"弟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002088","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"少弟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002089","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"少子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002089","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"長者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0130","start":130,"e